Z||000008||jmw||09-11-2000||06:22 PM||||Personally, I LOVE orange, and yellow. My two faves. On Corvettes they used to call it "competition yellow". Love those eye-popping sparkly blues too. I also sort of like that dang periwinkle-purpley color on the old Honda DelSol's. Think Toyota Celica's had that color too, although it may be too girly for a Fiero. That terra cotta orangey-bronze is nice too, with a tan interior, like on the Mitsu Eclipse. GM had a similar color, think it was called "cayenne". I don't know squat about paint, but I agree with everyone else -- do what YOU love. No matter what, your Fiero will still be one of a kind. Is fun to dream (sigh)...||||reg||7
